{"product_id":"halo-pro","title":"Halo Pro Headphones","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"481\"\u003eThe Halo Pro Headphones are designed for immersive audio, powerful noise cancellation, and long-lasting performance. Featuring hybrid ANC + ENC technology, large 40mm drivers, ultra-low latency, and extended battery life, they deliver a premium listening experience for music, calls, and everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"1ma7m6t\" data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"498\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"695\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"539\"\u003eHybrid ANC + ENC Noise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e – Advanced active noise cancellation combined with environmental noise reduction minimizes external noise for a focused listening and calling experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"816\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"718\"\u003eDual 40mm Drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e – Equipped with powerful 2×40mm drivers for deep bass, clear vocals, and balanced sound output.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"921\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"848\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Stable and fast wireless connection with a range of up to 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1023\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"956\"\u003eUltra-Low Latency Mode (20ms)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Seamless audio synchronization for gaming and video streaming.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1128\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1053\"\u003ePhysical Button Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easy and precise control over music, calls, volume, and ANC functions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1222\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1155\"\u003eIPX4 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Resistant to sweat and light splashes, suitable for daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1310\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1246\"\u003eQuick Pairing Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Red and blue LED indicators guide fast and easy connection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1315\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"18thdu9\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1338\"\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1420\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1361\"\u003e45 Hours Playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long-lasting battery life for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1499\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1449\"\u003e500mAh Battery Capacity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Powerful built-in battery for extended usage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1577\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1526\"\u003e50 Hours Standby Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Efficient standby performance when not in use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1653\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1604\"\u003e4 Hours Charging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully recharge with Type-C charging support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1732\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1674\"\u003eType-C Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Modern and reliable charging interface (DC 5V input).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1737\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"1khwwct\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1761\"\u003eAudio \u0026amp; Performance\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1847\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1795\"\u003eFrequency Range (20Hz–20KHz)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Full-range audio for deep bass and crisp highs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1920\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1866\"\u003e32Ω Impedance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Balanced sound output with efficient power usage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1993\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1943\"\u003e105dB Sensitivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Loud and clear sound with minimal distortion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2073\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2017\"\u003e3 Microphone Setup\u003c\/strong\u003e – Enhanced voice clarity for calls and communication.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2168\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2100\"\u003e-22dB Noise Reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e – Effective background noise suppression for better call quality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2173\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"1jb9d1k\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2192\"\u003eSmart Controls\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2732\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"jvqds4\" data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2258\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2212\"\u003ePower On\/Off\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold power button for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1tlx6uk\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2300\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2277\"\u003ePlay \/ Pause\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press power button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1vdv5mg\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2359\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2317\"\u003eNext Track\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold Volume + for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1kuabcm\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2422\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2380\"\u003ePrevious Track\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold Volume – for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"kzm9yj\" data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2472\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2443\"\u003eVolume Control\u003c\/strong\u003e – Tap Volume + \/ – buttons\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ucahzf\" data-start=\"2473\" data-end=\"2513\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2490\"\u003eAnswer Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press power button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"101am5u\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2559\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2531\"\u003eReject Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long press power button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1jzrfgp\" data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2612\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2576\"\u003eANC ON\/OFF\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press wave button for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1dpk2m0\" data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2657\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2628\"\u003eGame Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Single press wave button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"iftlyf\" data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2732\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2677\"\u003eFactory Reset\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold Volume + and Volume – for 5 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2737\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"7o52ou\" data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2760\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"3195\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1p2vn9c\" data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2808\"\u003ePremium over-ear wireless headphone design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ldrgqs\" data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2865\"\u003eLightweight build (~221.5g) for comfortable long use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1pw00nu\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2918\"\u003eErgonomic structure for better fit and stability\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1ukt9rp\" data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2979\"\u003eBluetooth protocol support for wide device compatibility\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1c0pp1i\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3030\"\u003eLED indicators for charging and pairing status\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1n1neu5\" data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3098\"\u003eCompatible with Android, iPhone, laptops, and Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"19256mj\" data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3148\"\u003eIncludes headphones and Type-C charging cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1hhhy1b\" data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3195\"\u003eAvailable in Black, Green, and Gold colors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3200\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3394\"\u003eThe Halo Pro Headphones combine powerful sound, intelligent noise cancellation, and long battery life — making them the perfect choice for users who want a premium wireless audio experience.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rose gold","offer_id":51262216339734,"sku":"24160","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":51262216274198,"sku":"24159","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Matt Black","offer_id":51262216306966,"sku":"24158","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Army Green","offer_id":51262216241430,"sku":"24161","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Halo_Pro_1.webp?v=1777723827","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/halo-pro","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}